classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ design. Update in Phase 6 to match the final implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +str day_start
        +list~str~ preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +remove_pet(pet_name: str) bool
        +get_pet(pet_name: str) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +int age
        +str notes
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(description: str) bool
        +get_pending_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str description
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str frequency
        +str time
        +str category
        +bool completed
        +date last_completed
        +str pet_name
        +date due_date
        +mark_complete() None
        +priority_rank() int
        +is_due_today() bool
        +next_occurrence() Task
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +date today
        +list~tuple~ plan
        +list~tuple~ skipped
        +collect_tasks() list~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name, completed, tasks) list~Task~
        +mark_task_complete(task: Task) Task
        +sort_by_priority(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +generate_plan() list~tuple~
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : needs
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads tasks via get_all_tasks()
    Scheduler ..> Task : schedules
